# Goal: Document and enforce how SmartBoardAI manages secrets, validates API access, protects data in transit/at rest, and reviews security changes.

## Create the branch from main, up to date
git checkout main
git pull origin main

## create and push the branch
git checkout -b security-measure
git push -u origin security-measure 

